\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 15:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp027 val 判定阈值：<20% fail、20-25% weak (=SFT)、30%+ proceed Phase B。Reviewer\\\\n    指出 GRPO 从未在 val 超越 SFT baseline，train-val gap 是系统性风险。\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer pass/fail 评估揭示关键事实：51 个实验中所有 GRPO 的 val success 均为 0-12.5%，而\\\\n    SFT (exp019b) 已达 20%。exp026 的 32.81% 是 train success，已知 train-val 差距巨大（exp023c:\\\\n    train 29.7% vs val 6.25%）。因此 exp027 的判定必须基于 val success：(1) val<20% → MVP 失败，需\\\\n    pivot（换服务器跑 verl-agent 原版 or 重评项目）；(2) val 20-25% → GRPO 仅匹配 SFT，RL 训练贡献为零，需重新评估\\\\n    Phase B 是否建在 SFT 上；(3) val≥30% → GRPO 首次超越 SFT，Phase B 有意义的 baseline，proceed。A\\\\n    类会议需 val≥40% + 第二环境 + 模型规模实验，预估 500-800 GPU-h。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n    role: 被判定对象\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: exp026_step_independent_grpo\\\\n    role: 前置实验\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: exp019b_expert_sft_v3\\\\n    role: SFT baseline对照\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D036\\\\n  - D034\\\\n- id: D038\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 15:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: Reviewer 评估 exp027 pass/fail 论文可行性：修正 claim 强度阈值，确认 val success 是唯一判定标准\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 指出关键事实：GRPO 从未在 val 上超越 SFT baseline（RAGEN 框架内 6.25%）。exp026\\\\n    的 32.81% 是 train success 不是 val success，train-val 差距系统性存在（exp023c: train 29.7%\\\\n    vs val 6.25%）。但 Reviewer 混淆了两个 eval 框架：exp019b 的 20% 是 eval_sft_fast（非 RAGEN eval），RAGEN\\\\n    框架内 SFT baseline 是 6.25%（exp021 C003-compliant 16ep eval）。因此 exp027 val ≥ 20%\\\\n    = 3.2× SFT baseline，仍是有意义的 RL 贡献，不是\\\\\\\"仅匹配 SFT\\\\\\\"。但 Reviewer 对 A 类会议的要求评估（Phase B +\\\\n    ablation + 第二环境 + scaling = 500-800 GPU-h）是合理的。结论：val success 是唯一判定标准，train success\\\\n    仅作 training dynamics 参考；MVP 20% 的门槛在 RAGEN eval 框架下仍然有效且有意义。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: exp026_step_independent_grpo\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: exp021_ragen_sft_v4\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: exp019b_expert_sft_v3\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D036\\\\n  - D034\\\\n- id: D039\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: 论文 framing 方向锁定：cost-efficiency story，不走 performance story；ARES 为主要竞争对标\\\\n  rationale: Related work survey + Reviewer 评估揭示：ALFWorld SOTA 88-93%，我们最好 6.25%，即使\\\\n    exp027 达 40% 仍是 bottom tier，performance story 死路。唯一可行路径是 cost-efficiency framing——\\\\\\\"在接近\\\\n    Self-Guide 性能的前提下，通过 RL-trained selective verification 减少 verification 开销\\\\\\\"。ARES\\\\n    (arXiv 2603.07915) 是最近竞争者（per-step adaptive computation），差异化点：(1) binary verify/not-verify\\\\n    决策更简洁可解释 vs ARES 连续 effort selection，(2) action-change 作为 environment-grounded\\\\n    reward signal vs ARES 的 SFT router，(3) interactive agent 场景 vs general reasoning。前提条件：baseline\\\\n    必须 ≥50%（接近 Self-Guide 72.7%），否则 cost-efficiency claim 无意义。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n    role: MVP gating\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: exp026_step_independent_grpo\\\\n    role: evidence for step-independent approach\\\\n    result: negative (peak 32.81% then collapsed)\\\\n  - exp_id: exp021_ragen_sft_v4\\\\n    role: SFT baseline\\\\n    result: 6.25% success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D038\\\\n  - D037\\\\n- id: D040\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修正 exp027 step 3 判定框架为三层阈值，Plan B kl_coef 上调至 0.015-0.02，中期评估 adaptive\\\\n    KL\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立评估确认 step 2 KL 0.058→0.413 (7x) 为强警告信号，kl_coef=0.005 约束过弱。exp026(KL\\\\n    collapse)+exp027(KL spike) 揭示固定 kl_coef 的 Goldilocks zone 极窄。修正：(1) 三层判定——绿(success≥10%+KL<0.3)、黄(success≥6.25%+KL\\\\n    0.3-0.6，准备 Plan B)、红(success<6.25%或KL>0.6，终止)；(2) Plan B kl_coef 从 0.01-0.02 收窄至\\\\n    0.015-0.02（0.01 在 exp026 已失败）；(3) 增加 entropy(<0.15=collapse)/pass@16(<0.5=零批次风险)/grad_norm(>25=不稳定)\\\\n    三个辅助监控维度；(4) 中期评估 adaptive KL 实现成本。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: step2 KL spike 0.413, success drop to 10.16%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp026_step_independent_grpo\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: 'symmetric failure: KL collapse to 0.0025'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D037\\\\n- id: D041\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp027 瓶颈诊断为 sparse reward 学习信号不足而非 KL 不稳定；Plan B(adaptive KL) 降级，Plan\\\\n    D(GiGPO/step-level credit) 升为首选备选路线\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立评估：(1) train success 连续两步 10.16%=plateau，pass@16 从 100%→50%\\\\n    说明仅 4/8 env groups 有学习信号；(2) exp026(太激进crash)+exp027(太保守plateau)构成稳定性-效率 dilemma，纯超参调整无法解决；(3)\\\\n    adaptive KL 解决的是 KL 振荡，但 KL 已自修正（0.413→0.248），不是当前瓶颈；(4) Self-Guide 同模型同环境达 72.7%，差异在\\\\n    step-level dense reward vs binary sparse reward；(5) GiGPO/step-level credit 打破\\\\n    plateau 概率 40-70% vs 当前 recipe 15-25%。决策：exp027 跑到 step 10（早停条件 train≤12%），并行准备\\\\n    Plan D。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: step2-3 train success plateau at 10.16%, pass@16 declining\\\\n  - exp_id: exp026_step_independent_grpo\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: aggressive config crashed, complementary failure mode\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D040\\\\n  - D037\\\\n- id: D042\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 建议：exp027 跑到 step 10 评估，同时并行准备 Plan D（GiGPO/step-level credit\\\\n    assignment），不再把 adaptive KL 作为首选 Plan B\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立评估 exp027 中期趋势：train success 连续两步 10.16% plateau，pass@16 从\\\\n    100%→50% 持续下滑，50 步内 val 突破 20% 概率 <10%。核心瓶颈已从 KL 不稳定（已自修正）转为学习信号密度不足——sparse binary\\\\n    reward + GRPO 在 8 env groups 下信号太稀疏。Adaptive KL 只解决 KL 振荡不解决信号密度问题。Self-Guide\\\\n    论文用同模型同环境达 72.7%，差异在 co-evolving internal reward（step-level dense reward）。Plan\\\\n    D（GiGPO/step-level credit）估计 40-55% 概率达 20% val，远高于当前 recipe 的 15-25%。决策：(1) exp027\\\\n    继续到 step 10（~12h），如 train success ≤12% 终止；(2) 立即并行准备 Plan D 代码和方案；(3) Adaptive\\\\n    KL 降级为 Plan D 的辅助选项而非独立方案。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: step 3 绿区但 plateau at 10.16%, pass@16 下滑\\\\n  - exp_id: exp026_step_independent_grpo\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: 对称失败模式：KL collapse vs KL spike\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D040\\\\n  - D037\\\\n- id: D043\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: Reviewer 发现 recipe gap 是根本问题：参考论文 GRPO baseline 72-73% vs 我们 10%，GiGPO\\\\n    集成继续但新增 recipe gap 诊断为最高优先级\\\\n  rationale: GiGPO 论文 Qwen2.5-1.5B GRPO=72.8%, Self-Guide 论文 Qwen3-1.7B GRPO=72.7%,\\\\n    我们 exp027 Qwen3-1.7B=10.16%@step3。62pp 的 baseline gap 说明瓶颈不在 RL 算法（GRPO vs GiGPO）而在训练\\\\n    recipe（SFT 起点质量/训练迭代数/环境配置/LR等）。GiGPO 改善 credit assignment 但不解决 recipe gap。必须系统对比训练配置找出差异根因。GiGPO\\\\n    集成继续（低成本），但预期从\\\\\\\"突破 40%+\\\\\\\"下调为\\\\\\\"增量未知\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: step3 train success 10.16%, baseline gap 62pp vs reference papers\\\\n  - exp_id: exp021_ragen_sft_v4\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: SFT baseline 6.25%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D041\\\\n- id: D044\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: Recipe Gap 确认三大根因：SFT 毒药 + binary reward 零梯度 + mini-batch 过小；Phase A 策略：Instruct\\\\n    冷启动 + invalid_action_penalty 最小变更验证\\\\n  rationale: Recipe Gap 六维对比发现参考论文（Self-Guide 72.7%, GiGPO）均从 Instruct 冷启动而非 SFT，且使用\\\\n    invalid_action_penalty 区分失败轨迹。我们的 SFT 破坏了 instruction-following 能力（baseline 6.25%），导致\\\\n    GRPO 零梯度。Phase A 只改两个变量隔离根因验证，GiGPO 算法切换暂缓（先修 recipe 再评估算法）。前置 zero-shot eval\\\\n    建立 Instruct 真实 baseline。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: step 1→3 success 35.9%→10.2%, 确认 sparse reward 零梯度\\\\n  - exp_id: exp026_step_independent_grpo\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative, 死亡螺旋\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D043\\\\n  - D041\\\\n  - D042\\\\n- id: D045\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp027 判定 MVP 未通过：train success 13.28%（step 4），pass@16 持续下降至 37.5%，模型特化而非泛化。Step\\\\n    5 未执行（进程异常终止）。\\\\n  rationale: 'Step 1→4 趋势：success 35.9%→10.2%→10.2%→13.28%（微升但远低于 20% MVP 阈值），pass@16\\\\n    100%→62.5%→50%→37.5%（单调下降=探索能力丧失）。历史 train-val gap（exp023c: train 29.7% vs val\\\\n    6.25%）表明 val 不可能达 20%。D044 recipe gap 分析确认根因为 SFT 毒药 + binary reward 零梯度。进程在 step\\\\n    4 后异常终止（earlystop worker 可能误杀或自然崩溃），step 5 val 和 checkpoint 均未生成。基于充分的 train 证据直接判定，不补跑\\\\n    val。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: MVP 未通过, train success 13.28%, pass@16 37.5%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D044\\\\n  - D040\\\\n  - D037\\\\n- id: D046\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 21:05 UTC\\\\n  summary: 继续 Phase A：exp028a Instruct 冷启动 + invalid_action_penalty 路线。零样本 eval ≥15%\\\\n    则直接提交；<15% 则重评项目\\\\n  rationale: D044 recipe gap 诊断是 52 个实验以来最具证据支撑的根因分析——参考论文（Self-Guide 72.7%, GiGPO\\\\n    72.8%）均从 Instruct 冷启动且使用 invalid_action_penalty，我们的 SFT 路线破坏了 instruction-following\\\\n    能力（baseline 6.25%）。exp028a 只改两个变量（Instruct 起点 + invalid_action_penalty），隔离验证 recipe\\\\n    gap 假设，成本低（预计 <50 GPU-h）。如果修复 recipe 后仍无法达到 20% val，说明瓶颈在 RAGEN 框架层面而非训练 recipe，项目需重评。零样本\\\\n    eval 阈值 15% 作为 Instruct 模型 baseline 下限——低于此说明模型本身能力不足，recipe gap 不是唯一问题。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n    role: MVP failed\\\\n    result: train success 13.28%, pass@16 37.5%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp028_prereq_zeroshot_instruct\\\\n    role: 前置验证\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: exp028a\\\\n    role: 下一实验\\\\n    result: preparing\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D044\\\\n  - D045\\\\n- id: D047\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 21:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 暂停 exp028a 最终定参，等零样本 eval 确认 Qwen3-1.7B base 能力后再决定 model_path 和训练起点\\\\n  rationale: 发现 Qwen3-1.7B 可能不存在独立 Instruct 变体（base/instruct 同权重，chat template 切换）。如果零样本确实\\\\n    ≈0%，D044 的\\\\\\\"SFT 毒药\\\\\\\"假设不成立——SFT 是从 0% 提升到 6.25% 的必要步骤，而非有害步骤。exp028a 的 model_path\\\\n    选择（base vs SFT checkpoint）完全取决于这个结果。penalty 修复可继续，但训练提交 hold 到零样本结论出来。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp028a\\\\n    role: blocked_by_diagnostic\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: exp028_prereq_zeroshot_instruct\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D044\\\\n  - D045\\\\n- id: D048\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 21:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp028a 采用 SFT checkpoint + invalid_action_penalty 最小变更方案，放弃 \\\\\\\"SFT是毒药\\\\\\\" 假设\\\\n  rationale: Qwen3-1.7B 本身就是 instruct 模型，不存在独立 -Instruct 版本。零样本 0%→SFT 6.25% 证明 SFT\\\\n    有益非有害。真正差距在 GRPO recipe（零梯度/binary reward/batch size）。MVP 阶段隔离单一变量：只加 invalid_action_penalty=-0.1\\\\n    解决零梯度问题，保留 SFT checkpoint 作为更好起点。Pass 阈值 ≥20%。Option 2（全面 recipe 对齐）变量过多，作为后备。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp028_prereq\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: Qwen3-1.7B 零样本 0%，确认即 instruct 模型\\\\n  - exp_id: exp021\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: SFT val 6.25%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: GRPO peak 35.9% → collapse 10-13%，零梯度问题\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D049\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 21:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D046: SFT必要性确认 + 下一步双GPU并行策略（D诊断→A+C并行）'\\\\n  rationale: 零样本0% vs SFT 6.25% vs SFT+GRPO 35.94%证明SFT是必要正效果，根因#1(SFT毒药)证伪。剩余根因#2(零梯度)和#3(mini-batch过小)需修复。策略：先跑5min诊断(enable_thinking=False零样本)排除格式干扰；penalty代码就绪后双GPU并行——一卡跑penalty+mb8，一卡跑penalty+mb32，同时验证根因#2和#3。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp021\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: SFT 0%→6.25% success, 0.75%→68.75% action_is_valid\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: SFT+GRPO step1 35.94% success\\\\n  - exp_id: D046\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: 零样本=0%确认instruct模型\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D050\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 21:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: '停止 exp028a（确认与 exp027 功能等价），根因 #2 也被否定，下一步全面对齐 Self-Guide recipe'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 三次报告确认：exp027 代码默认 invalid_action_penalty_coef=0.1 已生效（step_rewards.py\\\\n    在 exp027 启动前已存在，advantage/min 出现负值）。exp028a 显式设 0.1 = 重复 exp027。三大根因状态：#1 SFT毒药\\\\n    ❌(D047)、#2 零梯度 ❌(penalty 已生效但仍 10-13%)、#3 mini-batch 过小 ✅未验证。单变量策略连续两次未命中，MVP\\\\n    需要正面信号——改为对齐 Self-Guide recipe（mini-batch + steps + LR 同时调整），成功后再做 ablation 分解归因。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: penalty=0.1 已默认生效，仍 collapse 到 10-13%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp028a\\\\n    role: cancelled\\\\n    result: 确认与 exp027 功能等价，停止\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D051\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 03:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: Setup 审计发现 exp028c 非 Self-Guide 有效复现：step-independent 训练破坏信用分配 + self-guidance\\\\n    reward 缺失 + val 仅 16 episodes\\\\n  rationale: Agent 完成 6 维度审计，发现 5 个根本差异。最大嫌疑：RAGEN history_length=2 切断 episode-level\\\\n    训练导致长程信用分配失效（gamma^49=7.7%），完美解释 train success 波动但 val 不动。Self-guidance ±0.1 step\\\\n    reward（贡献 8%）完全未实现。Val 16 episodes 分辨率仅 6.25%。决策：exp028c 继续到 step 10 作 baseline\\\\n    数据点，同时开始 P0/P1 代码修复，修复后启动 exp029 作为真正复现。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp028c_selfguide_recipe\\\\n    role: 触发审计\\\\n    result: val success 6.25% = baseline after 5 steps\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n    role: 同类失败\\\\n    result: 相同 failure mode\\\\n  - exp_id: exp026_step_independent_grpo\\\\n    role: 同类失败\\\\n    result: 相同 failure mode\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D050\\\\n  - D045\\\\n  - D044\\\\n- id: D052\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 07:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp028c 终止：step 10 val success=0%（灾难性崩溃），MVP 确认失败。根因：step_independent h=2\\\\n    导致过拟合 train distribution + 灾难性遗忘 val。下一步 exp029 episode-level 训练。\\\\n  rationale: step_5_val best@128=10.0（满分）→ step_10_val best@800=0.0（完全归零）。模型在 train\\\\n    distribution 上仍有 10-22% success 但 val 从 6.25% 崩到 0%。D051 分析确认的结构性缺陷（step_independent\\\\n    h=2）获得最强实验证据：模型过拟合 train 局部 pattern 且灾难性遗忘 val 能力。继续训练浪费 GPU（已用 8.5h，剩余 68h）。立即终止释放\\\\n    GPU 给 exp029。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp028c_selfguide_recipe\\\\n    role: 终止\\\\n    result: step_10_val success=0%, catastrophic forgetting\\\\n  - exp_id: exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n    role: 同类失败\\\\n    result: train 13.28% peak, val 未测\\\\n  - exp_id: exp026_step_independent_grpo\\\\n    role: 同类失败\\\\n    result: 相同 failure mode\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D051\\\\n  - D050\\\\n  - D037\\\\n- id: D053\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 23:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 通过：episode-level GRPO step 5 val=25%（2x baseline），complete_mvp() 进入\\\\n    research 阶段\\\\n  rationale: Step 5 val success 25% 远超 15% 阈值（也超过了 step 10 的 25% 门槛）。对比 exp028c step_independent\\\\n    模式 step_5_val=6.25%，episode-level context window 证明解决了信用分配缺陷。训练稳定（grad_norm 1.0-1.7，无\\\\n    OOM），pass@8 峰值 75% 证明策略有潜力。KL 上升趋势需关注但不阻碍 MVP 判定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp029_episode_level\\\\n    role: MVP validation\\\\n    result: step_5_val=25%, train_peak=35.2%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp028c_selfguide_recipe\\\\n    role: negative control (step_independent)\\\\n    result: step_5_val=6.25%, step_10_val=0%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D051\\\\n  - D052\\\\n- id: D054\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 23:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Post-MVP framing pivot: dual contribution (episode-level training methodology\\\\n    + selective verification)'\\\\n  rationale: 'MVP 结果 (exp029 25% vs exp028c 0%) 证明 episode-level credit assignment\\\\n    本身是强贡献。原 D039 纯 cost-efficiency framing 依赖 baseline ≥50%（当前远未达到），风险过高。新 framing:\\\\n    Claim 1 (training methodology, already established) 为 primary, Claims 2-3 (selective\\\\n    verification) 为 conditional secondary。如果收敛后 <40%, Plan A 退到 pure methodology paper。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp029_episode_level\\\\n    role: primary_evidence\\\\n    result: step5_val=25%_2x_baseline\\\\n  - exp_id: exp028c_selfguide_recipe\\\\n    role: negative_evidence\\\\n    result: step10_val=0%_catastrophic_collapse\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D053\\\\n  - D051\\\\n  - D039\\\\n- id: D055\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 00:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream Review (weak reject) 响应：修正理论框架（γ decay → dual mechanism），加 GAE baseline，升\\\\n    seeds 至 5\\\\n  rationale: Dream simulate 返回 weak reject，核心问题：(1) γ^(T-h) 理论与 GRPO 不匹配（GRPO 无显式\\\\n    γ），(2) novelty 不足（episode-level 是 REINFORCE default），(3) 统计 power 不足，(4) 缺 GAE\\\\n    baseline。修正：理论改为 \\\\\\\"information bottleneck + gradient signal dilution\\\\\\\" 双机制；加 GAE(λ=0.95)\\\\n    baseline；multi-seed 升至 5；h-sweep 每个 h 3 seeds。总 GPU 预算 P0 从 268h 升至 438h。确认 dual\\\\n    contribution framing 保持（不退到纯 methodology）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp029_episode_level\\\\n    role: basis\\\\n    result: step5_val=25%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp028c_selfguide_recipe\\\\n    role: basis\\\\n    result: step10_val=0%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D054\\\\n  - D053\\\\n- id: D056\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 03:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: Negative 复盘发现：episode-level + valid_action_bonus 可能安全（exp013f gaming 是\\\\n    step_independent 特有），加入 h-sweep 批次验证\\\\n  rationale: exp013f 证伪了 \\\\\\\"dense reward shaping 帮助 GRPO\\\\\\\"，但其 gaming 行为（action_is_valid\\\\n    97% + task success 0%）是 step_independent 特有的：每步独立优化允许只最大化 per-step bonus。Episode-level\\\\n    下模型必须优化 trajectory-level total reward，无法独立 game。当前 exp029 的 action_is_valid=55.9%\\\\n    且在下降，加小 bonus 可能提供额外信号打破 23-25% plateau。这是从 negative 推导的假设，有明确的 parent 链。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp013f\\\\n    role: parent_negative\\\\n    result: reward gaming under step_independent\\\\n  - exp_id: exp029_episode_level\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: plateau at 23-25%, action_is_valid declining\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D055\\\\n  - D051\\\\n- id: D057\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 04:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: Early-stop exp029 at step 15 (val=28%, pass@8=92.9%), release GPUs for\\\\n    h-sweep (plan_002, paper core figure)\\\\n  rationale: 'Step 15 val=28.125% (marginal +3pp over step 5-10), action_is_valid\\\\n    degrading (78→55%), action_is_effective dropped to 77%. Continuing has low ROI:\\\\n    pass@8=92.9% already proves capability exists, main problem is consistency which\\\\n    current config won''t fix. h-sweep (plan_002) is P0 for paper — shows the cliff\\\\n    mechanism, directly addresses Dream C1/C2 reviewer concerns. Checkpoint preserved\\\\n    for future resume. Plan_003c (bonus variant) included in h-sweep batch.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp029_episode_level\\\\n    role: early_stopped\\\\n    result: step15_val=28.125%_pass@8=92.9%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp028c_selfguide_recipe\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: step10_val=0%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D056\\\\n  - D055\\\\n- id: D058\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 06:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Theory correction: \\\\\\\"flat advantage\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"γ-attenuated credit + undifferentiated\\\\n    failure\\\\\\\" based on source code verification'\\\\n  rationale: Agent 源码审计发现 RAGEN step_independent 实现中 compute_step_discounted_returns()\\\\n    使用 γ-discount，per-window return 不同（非 flat）。实际机制：成功 episode 早期 window 获 γ^k 衰减\\\\n    return（γ^{N-1}=γ^24≈29%, where N=⌈T/h⌉=25），失败 episode 所有 window 获相同近零 advantage。这比之前的\\\\n    \\\\\\\"identical advantage\\\\\\\" 假设更精确，也比最初的 \\\\\\\"GRPO has γ\\\\\\\" 更 nuanced（γ 在实现层非算法层）。批准 h=2 seed\\\\n    2 启用 per-window advantage logging 收集实证。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: hsweep_h2_seed1\\\\n    role: ongoing\\\\n    result: source code audit during run\\\\n  - exp_id: exp029\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: episode-level comparison\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D055\\\\n  - D056\\\\n- id: D059\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 08:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: h-sweep val 用 post-hoc full-context eval 替代 truncated val，不重启训练\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 hsweep val 也受 context_window_mode 影响（h=2 val step 0 = 0%），无法作为纯\\\\n    credit assignment 崩溃证据。解决方案：训练继续（收集 train metrics），完成后对所有 checkpoint 用 full context\\\\n    做 post-hoc val eval。这样 cliff figure 的 val 曲线只反映 training credit assignment 效果，不混入\\\\n    inference context 限制。不重启当前 seed 1（已跑 3h，train metrics 仍有价值）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: hsweep_h2_seed1\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: val step 0 = 0% due to context truncation\\\\n  - exp_id: exp028c\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: val uses full context, valid collapse evidence 6.25%→0%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D057\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 43377, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Hznqdr7H8VxtAyV9zYNBY8","session_id":"c1b768d7-c0d6-42f3-9a34-70349ec3e8c8","uuid":"51c76d10-e036-4ae3-8c29-a3c620ff84a1","timestamp":"2026-05-17T14:09:30.136Z"}
